            "\t * will automatically apply encounter.patient to all encounter.obs.patient",
            "\t * <p>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> save encounter with basic details<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> update encounter successfully<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> cascade save to contained obs<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> cascade patient to orders in the encounter<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> cascade save to contained obs when encounter already exists<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> cascade encounter datetime to obs<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> only cascade the obsdatetimes to obs with different initial",
            "\t * obsdatetimes<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> not overwrite creator if non null<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> not overwrite dateCreated if non null<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> not overwrite obs and orders creator or dateCreated<br/>",
            "\t * <strong>Should</strong> not assign encounter to visit if no handler is registered<br/>",
